{"articleNo":"608","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=608&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2009학년도 1학기 재입학 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.01.02","hit":"18499","attachments":[{"name":"2009학년도1학기재입학여석.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=608&attachNo=69250"},{"name":"2009학년도1학기재입학관련서식.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=608&attachNo=69251"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 'HY목각파임B'; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">▣ 2009학년도 1학기 재입학 안내 ▣</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">1. 재입학 대상</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;재학 중 자퇴, 미등록·미복학·미수강 및 학사경고 누적 등의 사유로 제적된 자.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">2. 재입학 자격 제한</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 41pt; TEXT-INDENT: -41pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">가. 학</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt\">부(과)의 재입학 심사에서 학생활동 등으로 제적된 자 중 개전의 정</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">이 없는 자로</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\"> 인정된 경우.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 학사경고로 제적된 후 1년이 경과되지 아니한 자.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 수학능력과 수업태도 등 학업활동을 계속할 수 없다고 판단되는 자.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 재입학 사실이 있는 자(재입학은 1회에 한함).</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">3. 재입학 신청 일정</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 재입학원서 접수기간 : <strong><font color=\"#0000cd\">2009. 1.13(화) ~ 1.15(목)[3일간]</font></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;☞ 재입학 신청 장소 : <strong><font color=\"#0000cd\">해당“종합학사행정실”</font></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 재입학 허가일 : <strong><font color=\"#0000cd\">2009. 2. 5(목)</font></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">다. 수강신청 기간 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2009. 2. 17(화)~2. 18(수) 1학년, 4학년이상</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2009. 2. 19(목)~2. 20(금) 2학년, 3학년</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; COLOR: #282828; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><font color=\"#0000cd\">라. 등록 기간 : 2009. 2.17(화) ~2. 20(금)</font></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">4. 재입학 구비서류 양식</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\"> : 해당 종합학사행정실 비치 또는 학교 홈페이지 다운로드</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 재입학 원서 1부(다운로드 가능)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 학적부 사본 및 성적증명서 각 1부</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 학생 자필로 된 각서 및 학부장 추천서 각 1부(다운로드 가능)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">5. 기타사항</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 재입학은 여석이 있는 경우에 한하여 허가함.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 재입학은 제적 당시의 동일학년 이하의 학년에 한하여 허가함.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;☞ 제적 당시의 학부(과, 전공)로만 재입학이 가능함 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 재입학자가 기 취득한 학점 및 성적은 그대로 인정함.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 42.2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -42.2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 재입학 이전에 받은 학사경고와 휴학기간은 재입학 이후에 통산하지 아니함.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 38.6pt; TEXT-INDENT: -38.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;마. 재</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">입학이 허가된 자는 소정의 기일 내에 입학금 및 기타 납입금의 납부 등 학적 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">절차를 이행하여야 하며, 하지 않을 경우 미등록 제적 처리함.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 42.6pt; TEXT-INDENT: -42.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<font color=\"#ff0000\"> </font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: -1.2pt\"><font color=\"#ff0000\">바. 재입학 합격은 해당 종합학사행정실 및 학교 홈페이지 공지사항에서 직접 확인(개별 연락하지 않음)</font></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 38.6pt; TEXT-INDENT: -38.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;사.</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\"> 2005학년도 이전 입학한 학생 중 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">기</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">계공학부, 전자공학부, 컴퓨터공학부, 건축학부</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">(건</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">축공학전공)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">토목환경공학부, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\">신소재시스템</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">공</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">학부에 재입학하는 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">학생은 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">공학EIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"&gt;비</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">인증</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">과정을 선택하여 이수해야 함.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 42.2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -42.2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;☞ 공학교육인증</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">․</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">비인증 과정을 선택하지 않은 학생만 해당.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 38.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -38.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;아. 학적부에 사진이 없는 학생은 사진 1장을 추가로“종합학사행정실”에 제출해야 하며, 원스톱서비스에 있는 주소와 연락처를 정확히 기재하여야 함.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 42.2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -42.2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;☞ 사진이 없을 경우 성적 열람 불가.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\"></span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">2009. 1. 2.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">금오공과대학교총장</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
